{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，当 flavor='seurat_v3' 时，高变基因选择期望输入为计数数据，而不是对数化数据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态为 raw_integer_counts，属于原始整数计数，符合 seurat_v3 对计数数据的要求。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "该要求还禁止输入已经过归一化、log1p、缩放或整合变换的数据；当前原始整数计数不落入这些禁止变换。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，在未提供 counts 层且矩阵本身为原始整数计数的情况下，该矩阵可以直接作为 seurat_v3 高变基因选择的输入。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "必要的下一步是确认矩阵中的值确实为原始 UMI 计数，且未经过任何归一化或对数变换；若存在其他预处理，则需先恢复为计数数据。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
